ddressbook><name>IKEDA SHIGERU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAMADA TATSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SASAKI NOBORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IKEDA, SHIGERU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAMADA, TATSUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SASAKI, NOBORU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A bed device that a worker can easily move the body of a user in diagnosing and nursing the user lying on the back on a floor plate, comprising a bed frame (5), wherein a second recessed part (24) is formed in the bed frame (5) on at least one side of the lateral both sides of a floor plate (21) where the floor plate (21) is installed so that it is recessed toward the lateral inside of the bed frame (5), a supporting body (61) is installed in the second recessed part (24) movably toward the lateral inside of the floor plate, and a compression deformable auxiliary member is installed in a mattress device (51) put on the floor plate (21) at a position corresponding to the second recessed part (24).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un lit sur lequel un employé peut facilement déplacer une personne pour les besoins du diagnostic et des soins. La personne est couchée sur le dos, reposant sur une plaque plancher, qui comprend un cadre (5). Une seconde partie en retrait (24) est formée dans ce cadre (5), au moins sur un des deux côtés de la plaque plancher (21), laquelle est installée de manière à être en retrait vers l'intérieur latéral du cadre (5). Un support (61) est monté mobile dans la seconde partie en retrait (24), pouvant se déplacer vers l'intérieur latéral de la plaque plancher, et un élément auxiliaire déformable à la compression est prévu dans le matelas (51), qui est installé sur la plaque plancher (21) en une position correspondant à la seconde partie en retrait (24).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>